[{"title":"钓龙台怀古","author":"赵迪","text":"戍鼓城分散暮鸦，无诸故垒到堪嗟。\n青山犹记秦封域，芳草空馀越世家。\n逐鹿旌旗云汉杳，钓龙台榭夕阳斜。\n英雄牢落今千载，风雨萧萧起暮笳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31796,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽姬乔氏","author":"赵迪","text":"纱窗落日度黄昏，知是音容隔九原。\n华屋不闻灯下语，妆台空想镜中魂。\n香罗犹染残春泪，花径惟馀旧袜痕。\n独有南宫词客恨，多情何处向人论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31797,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王孟扬之京","author":"赵迪","text":"年来知己叹飘零，谁唱离歌复忍听。\n有恨空江芳草绿，多情落日故山青。\n云间征骑频催发，花外流觞祗暂停。\n秪恐分携愁不极，临风长醉莫教醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31798,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别舍弟宗一","author":"赵迪","text":"粤江江上思悠悠，若上扁舟双泪流。\n去国身飘天外叶，还家梦断海边秋。\n山从鸟影当空度，云傍猿声入夜愁。\n远道六千过桂岭，穷荒垂死岂堪投。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31799,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送宫人入道","author":"赵迪","text":"净洗红妆翠黛残，承恩却向太清坛。\n罗襦已解明珠佩，宝髻新簪碧玉冠。\n昼永閒依松下鹤，春深犹梦镜中鸾。\n碧云凉月秋衾冷，还似昭阳独寝寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31800,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钱塘怀古","author":"赵迪","text":"龙飞凤舞下钱塘，冠盖朱轮散异方。\n王业偏安新典礼，山河无复旧封疆。\n铜驼雨冷依芳草，石兽云昏卧夕阳。\n今古废兴多少恨，一声孤雁海天长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31801,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉和圣制从蓬莱向兴庆阁道中留春望之作","author":"赵迪","text":"陪游禁苑早春前，莺啭春风入绮筵。\n柳外翠华承日转，花前阁道与天连。\n管弦声动千林晓，草木晴浮万井烟。\n自是宸游多睿藻，子云偏得侍甘泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31802,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过贾谊宅","author":"赵迪","text":"故宅荒凉倚碧岑，寒云漠漠迹难寻。\n书沈湘水情何极，鵩赋长沙怨已深。\n空馆无人啼鸟到，閒门有径碧苔侵。\n可怜前席今千载，惟有清猿自啸唫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31803,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏台至望亭驿人家尽空怅然有作寄从弟纡","author":"赵迪","text":"东吴黎庶独何依，景物凄清旧日非。\n芳草园林人不见，落花门巷燕还飞。\n干戈时起风尘暮，烽堠春来戍火微。\n高卧东山犹未起，洞中花发忆荼薇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31804,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登鼓山","author":"赵迪","text":"车从追游到上方，金宫钟磬霭林塘。\n彩云宝地通霄迥，翠壑松涛入海长。\n萝径引杯山鸟下，石厨供馔涧泉香。\n空堂清梵沈沈夕，共听三生色相忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31805,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题螺洲林公鲁小景","author":"赵迪","text":"茅屋松扉水畔村，居人殊胜武陵原。\n草深行径迷归路，花落春潮自到门。\n石上暝琴期宿客，林间微月动清猿。\n不知何处谢端宅，凄绝空江螺女魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31806,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西城夜月","author":"赵迪","text":"西城有明月，照彼崇台上。\n万籁夜沈沈，清光独相向。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31807,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小景","author":"赵迪","text":"茅屋掩芳林，萝衣卧苔石。\n空山寂无人，寒云落秋色。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31808,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"虚室弦声","author":"赵迪","text":"空斋寂无人，丝桐奏流水。\n飞絮落寒潭，静逐浮云起。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31809,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋江渔唱","author":"赵迪","text":"渔舟晓唱来，声度芦花影。\n月落曲未终，江空钓丝冷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31810,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远屿堆蓝","author":"赵迪","text":"微茫江上峰，青青雨中积。\n幽人兴无穷，闭门对秋色。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31811,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸂鶒","author":"赵迪","text":"朝浴湖水滨，暮宿菰蒲里。\n偶值荡舟人，双双复飞起。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31812,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书郑公启扇","author":"赵迪","text":"幽人爱青山，结屋空林里。\n夜深梦白云，明月在溪水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31813,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题山水 其一","author":"赵迪","text":"几家茅屋水边村，花落春潮夕到门。\n溪上数峰青似染，居人说是武陵原。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31814,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题山水 其二","author":"赵迪","text":"江上千峰紫翠浮，松门苔径映清流。\n茅堂雨绝湘帘暝，卧听空山一夜秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31815,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题山水 其三","author":"赵迪","text":"九嶷如黛暮云间，帝子何年去不还。\n唯有清猿听不尽，潇潇寒雨万重山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31816,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题山水 其四","author":"赵迪","text":"流水人家洞里幽，清猿古木思悠悠。\n别家几度藤萝月，閒却瑶琴石上秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31817,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈文叔分教融州","author":"赵迪","text":"别来三载一相逢，百越云山意万重。\n回雁峰高霜月冷，梦魂犹忆帝城钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31818,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伏枕","author":"赵迪","text":"衰病龙钟两鬓华，荷衣弱体不胜加。\n空山遥夜人声绝，一点残灯落尽花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31819,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画马","author":"赵迪","text":"塞上番儿控骕骦，岂知天厩有乘黄。\n春风驰道花如锦，玉勒骄嘶出建章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31820,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题郑介叔扇","author":"赵迪","text":"谷口幽居迥不忘，青山修竹旧书堂。\n别来十载林间月，风落松花入梦香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31821,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送林汉孟之温陵","author":"赵迪","text":"年来知己各离群，况是春深又别君。\n柳色青青芳草绿，停杯凄绝一江云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31822,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄沈鲁原","author":"赵迪","text":"绿萝潭岛碧纷纷，门掩青山独卧云。\n残月空江清梦远，令人长忆沈休文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31823,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塘上行","author":"林敏","text":"石发明濯濯，江蓠复田田。\n蘼芜独何为，零落朝露先。\n深塘会有涯，别木仍有颠。\n条风江上行，忧来悄无边。\n罗衣怯素体，斋沐况经年。\n尝以兰蕙心，喻作金石坚。\n谁谓胶与漆，中道成弃捐。\n不食莲菂苦，焉知萍实妍。\n不叹蒲柳老，翻疑雨露偏。\n人影乱止水，飞魂逐榆烟。\n大堤回辇处，合沓生苔钱。\n愁闻歌绿水，往古皆共然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31824,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词","author":"林敏","text":"杳杳紫金阙，飞甍集祥云。\n玉女拥龙旂，执节推朱轮。\n玄元降纶音，列坐诸天君。\n琼台雨宝花，仙众何缤纷。\n赤舄跨青牛，黄冠骖鹤群。\n冲虚奏铙吹，不许世人闻。\n臣愚但长跽，垂绅诉衷勤。\n秦皇欲不死，服食空多门。\n汉武铸金茎，未能沃心焚。\n敕赐太上符，真诠秘其文。\n假合作容貌，蝉蜕超埃氛。\n瑶池洗毛髓，彩翠仍氤氲。\n五内洞灵曜，三葩吐奇芬。\n芝草产玉田，呼龙自耕耘。\n忽而与天壤，心影无嶙峋。\n云霓为余驾，虎豹向我蹲。\n上见风雨迹，下见天地根。\n凌风逝不返，浩劫应长存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31825,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀宗兄林八左迁兴业长史","author":"林敏","text":"南宫归卧久，兴业左迁时。\n谁念连枝会，翻为梦草思。\n鹡鸰霜霰急，鸿雁信音迟。\n佐邑应多暇，长吟谢朓诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31826,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠医者","author":"林敏","text":"海上烟霞阔，山中岁月淹。\n引泉阴涧迥，采药晚风恬。\n迹比韩康隐，名将子训兼。\n长安无二价，犹是慕清廉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31827,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"林敏","text":"三生石上旧烟萝，九曲閒云倚醉过。\n满地松花仙梦觉，春声都入榜人歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31828,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿栖云庵","author":"李德","text":"众壑忽已暝，远近响清湍。\n山中对僧定，疏雨掩柴关。\n柳暗猿狖集，松交风露寒。\n揽衣中夜起，萝月在岩端。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31829,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居","author":"李德","text":"北窗林影寂，南湖水气凉。\n园荷始泛绿，丛兰渐吐芳。\n抚节迹犹滞，神閒机已忘。\n无论喧与寂，缅心即羲皇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31830,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山行","author":"李胜原","text":"径入云深处，行行日欲斜。\n山环六七里，溪绕两三家。\n隔竹闻飞瀑，随风看落花。\n村翁偶相值，且与话桑麻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31831,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望黄山","author":"李胜原","text":"望中何处是黄山，山色空濛紫翠间。\n六六奇峰开海岛，重重彩雾拥仙关。\n雨腥洞口龙应出，月冷松梢鹤未还。\n我欲乘风凌绝顶，轩辕云驾直须攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31832,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过郭公岭题山店壁","author":"李胜原","text":"薄暮风前暑气收，扶筇岭上纵吟眸。\n一团林麓云深处，三两人家山尽头。\n无酒可沽酬旧识，有诗聊写记曾游。\n丈夫未必轻年少，宝剑龙光射斗牛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31833,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖口渡江过江州","author":"李胜原","text":"晓冲湖口发，残月五更前。\n勒马问寒戍，隔江呼渡船。\n剑锋淬淮水，旗影壮山川。\n祖逖应如是，吾心亦慨然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31834,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚上江州","author":"李胜原","text":"去去浔阳江水长，望中风物转堪伤。\n玉楼金屋成荒土，古木寒鸦空夕阳。\n城市高低三十里，人家兴废几多场。\n英雄草昧瓜分处，大业终归是圣皇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31835,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过石几岭庄舍漫书","author":"李胜原","text":"少年意气本豪雄，望望云霄第几重。\n身计独怜长在客，世情何似早归农。\n一犁新雨春耕足，半醉香醪逸兴浓。\n寄语诸公秋有望，黄鸡白酒记相逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31836,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日偕杨大使张河泊李通判党县尹诸公宴饮漫述短篇","author":"李胜原","text":"谁家老圃饶秋色，青蕊重阳不堪摘。\n渊明何不早辞归，把酒花前还约客。\n菊花菊花须早开，客来且与相徘徊。\n风枝露蕊各生态，不妨日日供樽罍。\n诸君意气自豪放，一咏一觞足吟赏。\n挥毫肯让谪仙才，举杯不尽刘伶量。\n君不见牛山之泣情何伤，龙山帽落兴何狂。\n台前戏马亦豪杰，登高囊佩茱萸香。\n嗟我年年长在客，淮水淮山浮梗迹。\n故园三径已荒凉，如此良辰莫虚掷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31837,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登浙源岭半山庵","author":"李胜原","text":"万山更深处，云是浙之源。\n山半庵初结，林间雾欲昏。\n清泉流石壁，野犬吠柴门。\n偶尔得佳句，呼僮问酒樽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31838,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过羊二桥","author":"李胜原","text":"突兀此溪亭，伊谁博济心。\n野禽时送语，绿树昼交阴。\n流水有深浅，青山无古今。\n我来成小憩，秋气净烦襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31839,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泾县白花桥铺候吕景初","author":"李胜原","text":"梨花飞雪柳飞绵，风日晴和三月天。\n满眼溪山饶逸兴，一村桑柘带朝烟。\n吹醒旅梦谁家笛，噪落夕阳何处蝉。\n邈矣钟期无觅处，素琴张壁未须弦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31840,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宝应即景","author":"李胜原","text":"宿鹭眠鸥水满田，败荷疏柳雨晴天。\n帘招村市谁家酒，风送帆樯何处船。\n隔岸数声牛背笛，斜阳一抹渡头烟。\n沧洲风景那须画，著我居閒乐事便。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31841,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客中遣兴","author":"李胜原","text":"薰风初动日初长，红蹙榴花出短墙。\n旧识不来情思懒，北窗高枕卧羲皇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31842,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九月十五夜月蚀","author":"李胜原","text":"万里渊澄见斗参，官城禁鼓二更深。\n一轮蟾魄摩妖气，半夜金精犯太阴。\n风露有声秋耿耿，山河无影暗沉沉。\n凭栏何处孤吟客，亟欲圆回补缺心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31843,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"觅竹","author":"李胜原","text":"为爱君家千个竹，吾庐欲致两三竿。\n不栽也恐令人俗，多觅何妨著地宽。\n未拟丛中留凤宿，且看根下有龙蟠。\n愿分风月归吟韵，共结坚盟到岁寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31844,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白燕","author":"李胜原","text":"年年春社渡江津，变化乌衣国里身。\n画栋营巢情有诉，缁衣换白净无尘。\n衔泥立幕双环玉，掠水穿花一剪银。\n莫是旧时王谢宅，閒披缟素不惊人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31845,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"睡燕","author":"李胜原","text":"新垒营成得所依，羽翰娇懒傍帘帏。\n閒思渡海兼天远，梦想衔泥带雨归。\n宿去巢中随蝶化，觉来花外引雏飞。\n临风试听呢喃语，似向东君说是非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31846,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送淮安刺史乃弟归","author":"李胜原","text":"十里长亭听马嘶，送君把酒过河堤。\n离心远逐东淮水，为报平安到陇西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31847,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过湖西失水道有作寄沈孟刚 其一","author":"李胜原","text":"扁舟一棹过湖西，芦苇丛深去路迷。\n刘阮天台更何处，重来难觅旧桃溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31848,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过湖西失水道有作寄沈孟刚 其二","author":"李胜原","text":"平湖远挂一帆风，烟水茫茫入望中。\n水道忽迷天又晚，芦花深处问渔翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31849,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂咏","author":"李胜原","text":"折得野棠花半开，媚人颜色傍樽罍。\n东风瞰我灯前醉，又送啼鹃雨后来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31850,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书田家壁","author":"李胜原","text":"四顾溪山景物嘉，欢同野老话桑麻。\n数声鸡犬白云坞，半亩池塘青草蛙。\n官税早偿农力足，茅檐低逐竹篱斜。\n我来应作田园主，宛是柴桑处士家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31851,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过龙门滩同元帅叔至应天府","author":"李胜原","text":"浪拍龙门乱石滩，满篷风雨听潺湲。\n东迎麻口一村水，西望泾阳数点山。\n千古诗名留白下，半生心事损朱颜。\n短吟寄语岩栖士，莫道功名只等閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31852,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采石","author":"李胜原","text":"夜深风静水无波，独立江头且浩歌。\n买酒放怀人醉后，满船无奈月明何。\n袁宏泊渚名犹在，温峤燃犀恨已多。\n明日江头挂帆去，兴来重淬剑锋多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31853,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬子春同方虎轻过桃岭次韵","author":"李胜原","text":"系马山前崄欲攀，山深忽听水潺湲。\n烟霞掩映层峦外，楼阁参差古树间。\n仙境已知尘世隔，俗人不到洞门閒。\n我来驻屐仍留句，惊起潜龙涌出关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31854,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题旌德三溪驿舍","author":"李胜原","text":"十里长亭路，行行骢马嘶。\n桑麻蔽平野，潦水涨前溪。\n一曲晚蝉噪，数声山鸟啼。\n公行从此过，得兴自吟题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31855,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"济南午日同郭掾郎游龙洞二首 其一","author":"李胜原","text":"驻马探龙洞，崎岖石路分。\n数家新草舍，十里旧烟村。\n更有东山屐，须开北海樽。\n神仙此佳境，何必问桃源。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31856,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"济南午日同郭掾郎游龙洞二首 其二","author":"李胜原","text":"今日端阳作胜游，行行马上纵吟眸。\n几层古塔崖高处，一窟清泉山尽头。\n龙去洞寒云气湿，客来风静鸟声幽。\n石边满把蒲觞泛，顿觉满怀无限秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31857,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鲁港","author":"李胜原","text":"一日风帆驾雪涛，晚来牵缆此江皋。\n远山云外横千里，新水船头长半篙。\n鸥鸟惊飞前渚去，乌鸦又向隔林号。\n倚篷酒醒寒相逼，唤起山童整敝袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31858,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹤珠潭","author":"李胜原","text":"鹤珠潭深水澄碧，下有层澜几千尺。\n泥沙安得蛟龙蟠，云日时看鱼鸟閒。\n茅屋人家水西曲，门前绿草眠黄犊。\n好风肯便挂征帆，陵山载酒游仙岩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31859,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泾县即事","author":"李胜原","text":"古木荒碑对县门，数家烟火自黄昏。\n河流故绕山边市，驿路斜通郭外村。\n烟雨园林梅结子，春风篱落竹生孙。\n愁看市井萧条甚，丧乱曾经几戍屯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31860,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙湾江口作","author":"李胜原","text":"滚滚红尘两鬓斑，经年为客滞江关。\n梦驰乡井今归去，恨逐江云几往还。\n野色带烟迷雁渚，橹声摇月出龙湾。\n一樽自酌堪消遣，回首扬州数点山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31861,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题冯进士养质山水画","author":"李胜原","text":"青山叠叠静当户，长松挺挺凌烟雨。\n数椽茅屋竹树间，中有高人抱幽趣。\n翠岩丹壑深几重，水绕人家隔秋浦。\n石岩突兀不可攀，茫茫远水难为渡。\n瑶草琪花满涧阿，彩霞瑞霭开林坞。\n山中采药人未还，夭桃秾李迷归路。\n冯君抱负经济才，绿袍新著登天府。\n奈何亦有丘壑情，持兹图绘索余句。\n披图便觉逸思飘，荏苒巾袍袭烟雾。\n山明水秀有如此，恨不携家此中住。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31862,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]